export anchor NeobankVibrantStyle:
    number: 365
    screen: FinanceBudget
    name: Neobank vibrant
    idea: A phone first bank on pure black with one electric volt accent, a giant tabular balance, round action buttons, fat rounded cards and pill meters, where overspend flips a tile to white instead of turning red.
    base: dark
    palette:
        black: #000000, the page and the style sheet
        card: #151515, account cards, tiles, the goal and the transaction list
        cardTwo: #222222, raised cards, action circles, chips and fields
        line: #333333, pill tracks and the ring track
        white: #ffffff, text, meters and the inverted over budget tile
        muted: #a3a3a3, labels, decimals and dates
        volt: #d4ff3a, the single accent for the euro sign, Add money, the goal ring, income, money left and focus
        onVolt: #0b0d00, text on volt
    type:
        One system stack, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, Helvetica
        Neue, Arial, heavy weights. Base 15px. The balance is 88px at 850
        tracked minus .05em with the euro sign and decimals at 44px, the sign in
        volt and decimals in muted. Tile figures are 30px at 850, section titles
        22px at 850, body 15px at 700 and badges 12px at 800.
    layout:
        A 1200px app. The top row has a volt rounded square b mark, the name, a
        pill tab group on the right with Home as a white pill, and an MO disc.
        Below, a 440px left column and a wide right column. The left column
        reads Hey Mara, here's October, then the giant everyday balance with
        Everyday account under it, three 60px round actions Add money in volt,
        Send and Move, two 28px rounded account cards for Savings and Credit
        card with a small chip outline and the figure at the bottom, the card
        one showing a clock and Due 12 Nov, then a goal card with a thick volt
        ring at 64 percent beside Japan trip, 3,200 of 5,000 and the date. The
        right column has October budget with 1,870 spent of 1,930, one segmented
        pill showing each category and a volt end for the 60 left, then a three
        by two grid of 24px tiles, one per category with a badge, the figure
        over the limit and a pill meter, plus a volt All budgets tile with 60
        left. Eating out is a white tile with black text, a black Over by 62
        badge and a black hatched pill. Latest is a rounded list with initials
        discs, the salary disc and amount in volt. Below 1100px the columns
        stack and tiles go two across.
    spacing:
        An 8px unit. 32px gutter, 48px between columns, 12px between cards, 18
        to 24px inside.
    density: Medium low. Big numbers first, then six tiles and a short feed.
    corners:
        Very round. 28px cards, 24px tiles, 20px rows, pills and circles for
        buttons, tabs and meters.
    borders: None. Cards separate from the black by fill alone.
    shadows: None.
    icons:
        Bold glyphs in circles for actions and initials discs for payees. Badges
        pair a circle check with money left, a ruled square with Maxed and a
        triangle with Over by 62. A clock marks the due date.
    focus: A 3px volt outline offset 3px.
    tone:
        Casual second person, such as Hey Mara, here's October, 64 left, Maxed,
        Over by 62 and Latest.
